    <TD><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><B>Exercise Price per Share: $11.50</B></FONT></TD>
    <TD><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><B>Warrant No.&nbsp; [<FONT STYLE="font-family: Symbol">&middot;</FONT>]</B></FONT></TD></TR>
